      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The menopause is a fact of life for every woman, and how it affects her depends on her physiologic makeup and on her emotional health. An empathetic physician is a great help to the patient going through this stage of life. Whether to offer hormone replacement therapy is a question each physician in general or gynecologic practice must answer."},
